WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:03.550
Someone finds your Perth cleaning
business on Google.

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.300
Where you work or how to get a quote,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.050
they may just move on.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:11.760
Local Lift reviews your
Google Business Profile,

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.550
website and quote form
from a customer’s point of view.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.000
We show you where they might get stuck

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:18.550
and what to fix first.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:23.000
You’ll get suggested wording,
where to put it,

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.930
and what to check once it’s live.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.350
Take a look at our sample audit
to see what you’d get.
